WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.514
In tutorial 7.6, you'll read your audit,
hand your developers the fix pack,

00:00:11.564 --> 00:00:13.655
and watch your key pages every day.

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:16.810
First, open Technical health.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:21.235
The top shows your health score and what
changed since the last audit: fixed,

00:00:21.285 --> 00:00:22.774
new and still open.

00:00:23.743 --> 00:00:27.721
Pick any past audit from the list
at the top, to see it the same way.

00:00:29.818 --> 00:00:33.763
Next, the fix pack holds ready-made
files for your developers.

00:00:33.813 --> 00:00:36.778
Download each one here,
then click How to apply it.

00:00:38.743 --> 00:00:40.818
The guide walks you through every step,

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.660
and you can copy the steps
or send them to a colleague.

00:00:46.293 --> 00:00:49.218
Worth fixing next shows what to do first.

00:00:49.268 --> 00:00:52.618
Daily key-page watch checks
your key pages every morning,

00:00:52.668 --> 00:00:55.277
and alerts you the same
day something changes.

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:58.943
Health score over time shows every audit,

00:00:58.993 --> 00:01:01.971
and Issues by category shows
where the problems sit.

00:01:03.268 --> 00:01:07.318
In Findings, filter by
severity, status or category.

00:01:07.368 --> 00:01:10.400
Click Open to see the issues
still waiting for a fix.

00:01:11.789 --> 00:01:15.984
Fixed one? Click I fixed this, and
it's checked again the next morning.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:21.276
Or use Create ticket to open it in Jira,
Linear or Asana, if you connected one.

00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:26.181
Finally, Audit reports keeps
every audit, with its PDF,

00:01:26.231 --> 00:01:28.354
its Word copy and its fix pack.

00:01:29.359 --> 00:01:32.834
So you know what to fix first,
your developers get the files,

00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:35.553
and you hear the same day
when a key page breaks.

00:01:36.568 --> 00:01:40.968
So, read the health score, download
the fix pack, watch your key pages,

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:45.021
filter the findings, mark
fixes, and open past reports.

00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:51.310
Your site's health is in hand. Next,
record the monthly Search Console check-in,

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.402
in tutorial 7.7.
